@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@companyAdminEmail = admin@al-salamah.com
@companyAdminPassword = User@123456
@missingJob = 3f9a1c22-7b44-4e18-9d05-6c2e8a5f1b70
@missingContract = 6b2e8a5f-1b70-4e18-9d05-3f9a1c227b44

### =====================================================================
### 18. PERIODIC MAINTENANCE CONTRACTS (FR-MNT, `13_*` §2.5)
### =====================================================================
### A contract is opened on a maintenance job the client already accepted — the price, the VAT and
### the acceptance all live on that job's quotation, so nothing commercial is re-entered. What the
### contract adds is the schedule: an annual quarterly agreement lays out four visits at signing.
###
### Nobody creates a visit. The background scheduler raises each visit's job at its lead time
### (14 days by default), already at InExecution, because the work was sold once and does not need
### triaging or re-quoting four times a year. The job runs the normal WBS with EXIF-verified
### photographs and closes through the normal ceremony.
###
### The cadence must divide a year evenly (1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 12) and the term must be a whole number
### of those intervals, which is what keeps the last visit inside the cover instead of on the day
### it expires.
###
### The schedule arithmetic, the idempotence of the sweep, the missed-visit rules and the contract
### state machine are covered by MaintenanceSchedulingTests (xUnit) and by a scripted live run
### against SQL Server. This suite is a smoke test of the surface with explicit assertions.
### Field casing is camelCase (D-8).

### 18.1 Company Admin login
# @name companyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}", "password": "{{companyAdminPassword}}" }

?? status == 200

@companyAdminToken = {{companyAdminLogin.data.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Authentication
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 18.2 Unauthenticated contract list -> 401
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts

?? status == 401

### 18.3 Unauthenticated calendar -> 401
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/calendar

?? status == 401

### 18.4 Unauthenticated contract open -> 401
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 12 }

?? status == 401

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Reads
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 18.5 The company's contracts -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 18.6 Filtered to active contracts -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts?status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 18.7 The planning board, default ninety-day horizon -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 18.8 The planning board over an explicit window -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/calendar?fromUtc=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2027-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 18.9 A window that ends before it starts -> 400
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/calendar?fromUtc=2027-10-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400

### 18.10 Paging past the ceiling -> 400
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5000
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400

### 18.11 A contract that does not exist -> 404
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts/{{missingContract}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 404

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Validation — the schedule has to be one a calendar can express
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 18.12 A cadence that does not divide a year -> 400
### Five visits a year is 2.4 months apart, which is not a date anyone can write in a contract.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 12, "visitsPerYear": 5 }

?? status == 400

### 18.13 A term that is not a whole number of intervals -> 400
### Ten months at a quarterly cadence would leave the last visit outside the cover.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 10, "visitsPerYear": 4 }

?? status == 400

### 18.14 A term beyond the five-year ceiling -> 400
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 120 }

?? status == 400

### 18.15 A lead time longer than a quarter -> 400
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 12, "leadTimeDays": 400 }

?? status == 400

### 18.16 A one-word cancellation reason -> 400
### The reason is what the client is told when their cover stops.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts/{{missingContract}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "reason": "no" }

?? status == 400

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Not found — a valid request against something that is not there
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 18.17 Opening a contract on a job that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "instanceId": "{{missingJob}}", "startsOnUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "termMonths": 12, "visitsPerYear": 4 }

?? status == 404

### 18.18 Cancelling a contract that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/contracts/{{missingContract}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "reason": "The client sold the facility to a new owner." }

?? status == 404

### 18.19 Rescheduling a visit that does not exist -> 404
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintenance/visits/{{missingContract}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "dueOnUtc": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z" }

?? status == 404
